{{#> layout title="Your sign-in code"}}
  <h1>Your sign-in code</h1>
  <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
  <p>Use this code to finish signing in to SaveApp.</p>
  {{> code code=code}}
  <p>This code expires in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes.</p>
  <p class="muted">If you didn't try to sign in, someone may know your password. Change it from My account and turn on two-step verification with an authenticator app.</p>
{{/layout}}
